{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\nTVB今晚（3日）震撼宣布，將破天荒推出結合「煮食」與「選秀」的全新綜藝真人騷《星廚》，目標是發掘既有廚藝又有星味的「烹飪界型男索女」！為此節目已正式展開全球招募，誓要打造新世代偶像廚神，究竟誰能「入得廚房，出得廳堂」？\n</p>\n<h2>《星廚》結合煮食選秀 打造新世代偶像廚神</h2>\n<p>TVB近年成功打造多個話題選秀節目，這次推出的《星廚》將開拓全新偶像賽道。節目有別於一般煮食或選秀騷，不僅嚴格要求參賽者的烹飪實力，更會全面審視其舞台魅力、鏡頭感及個人風格等偶像特質，旨在尋找一位全方位的「新世代偶像廚神」。為隆重其事，節目於今日（3日）正式展開全球招募，並將於11月17日（周二）晚上11時59分（香港時間）截止報名，為有志者提供一個展現實力的華麗舞台。</p>\n<h2>新生代型男美女拍宣傳片 吳敬浩神還原謝霆鋒Chok甫</h2>\n<p>為了打響頭炮，TVB特別找來新生代型男吳敬浩（Justin）及美女陳芷珊（Tracy）拍攝首發宣傳片。片中二人換上多個造型，包括型男索女Look、古裝Look及廚師Look，陳芷珊大騷音樂才華彈結他賣萌，而吳敬浩則盡展舞功。最搶鏡的一幕，莫過於吳敬浩神模仿謝霆鋒經典的「灑鹽Chok甫」，姿勢入型入格，極具記憶點，成功為節目製造首個話題。</p>\n<h2>開拓全新偶像賽道 跳出傳統歌唱演藝框框</h2>\n<p>《星廚》的推出，標誌著TVB銳意跳出傳統歌唱及演藝選秀的框架，為偶像定義開創更多可能性。節目概念強調「廚藝＋星味」，意味著未來的偶像不僅要在鏡頭前發光發亮，更需要具備實用的生活技能，以更貼地的形象吸引觀眾。這種創新的比賽模式，旨在發掘更多元化的人才，為娛樂圈注入一股前所未見的新血，打破觀眾對偶像的既定印象。</p>\n<h2>網民期待值爆燈：「終於有新嘢睇！」</h2>\n<p>節目消息一出，立即引起網民熱烈討論，對新穎的節目形式表示期待。不少網民留言大讚有新意：「TVB終於有新嘢睇！煮食加選秀好似幾有gimmick！」、「想睇靚仔靚女煮嘢食，唔知啲評判係邊個？」、「全球招募？有冇年齡限制？有啲心動想報名！」亦有網民表示：「希望唔好又係劇本啦，想睇真實嘅廚藝比拼。」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01_13533326786ae97f9825dcb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/01_13533326786ae97f9825dcb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_18918224446ae97f9a8f91b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_15296971026ae97f9e077a1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_7563051466ae97fa1ce47d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_5849192556ae97fa51baa4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_5989789476ae97fabb74a7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_5989789476ae97fabb74a7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_4102792456ae97fb2df79c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_4102792456ae97fb2df79c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_18339345696ae97fb787748.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_18339345696ae97fb787748.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_17779194546ae97fbacebc6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2140309346ae97fc0bc19b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"星廚 tvb （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_20380693196ae97fc40c57a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T07:22:34.134342+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1190,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T06:33:06+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T07:59:05.365098+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T07:18:44.620312+00:00","content_hash":"c8a8f22284c0fe09241a2250252a6b8b91a142daafdbd876d308f7e6439f8474","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}